# Juvian Grid -- runtime-generated artifacts (never commit)

# Python bytecode
__pycache__/
*.pyc

# Tensor history ledgers (generated per node at runtime)
history_*.npy
*.npy

# Session key-chain persistence (generated per node at runtime)
*.frac

# Proof-of-work birth-certificate cache (generated alongside the identity key)
*.pow

# Node identity private keys -- NEVER commit these. They have no fixed
# extension (the path is operator-chosen via identity_path); if you keep them
# inside the repo directory, add their exact filenames here.
